WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:33.040
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:33.310 --> 01:37.390
[Manager: Found a sketch of a flower you did]

3
01:37.390 --> 01:39.380
Sakura. Breakfast is ready. [Should I mail it over to Singapore?]

4
01:39.380 --> 01:41.180
Coming.

5
01:43.930 --> 01:46.380
I thought it was my turn to cook today.

6
01:46.380 --> 01:49.150
You get a break for your first week living abroad.

7
01:49.150 --> 01:50.850
Who made that rule?

8
01:50.850 --> 01:52.700
Me. Just now.

9
01:52.700 --> 01:54.790
I wasn't informed.

10
01:54.790 --> 01:57.550
If you've got objections, I'll hear you out.

11
01:59.530 --> 02:02.240
- Thanks for breakfast. - You're welcome.

12
02:02.240 --> 02:05.730
First, we'll visit Merlion Park. Then, Mandai.

13
02:05.730 --> 02:09.600
Afterwards we'll take a river cruise, to close out the day in Marina Bay.

14
02:11.900 --> 02:13.720
What about here?

15
02:13.720 --> 02:15.080
Katong?

16
02:16.030 --> 02:18.000
Maybe not today.

17
02:18.000 --> 02:20.950
I want to make sure we catch the nighttime fountain show.

18
02:24.350 --> 02:27.210
You still haven't shared your location with me.

19
02:27.210 --> 02:29.160
I haven't.

20
02:29.160 --> 02:32.530
We're overseas. What if there's an emergency?

21
02:33.370 --> 02:35.700
You don't need to worry so much.

22
02:35.700 --> 02:38.220
I'm not a kid who's going to get lost.

23
02:38.220 --> 02:42.200
I know. But I feel better knowing I can come find you.

24
02:53.940 --> 02:55.450
Smile!

25
02:58.600 --> 03:03.100
We're lucky to have another Japanese guide join us.

26
03:03.100 --> 03:05.000
I look forward to working with you tomorrow.

27
03:05.000 --> 03:07.090
Likewise.

28
03:07.090 --> 03:11.740
Today, I want you to enjoy yourself, so you're ready to entertain our guests.

29
03:11.740 --> 03:12.650
Yes, ma'am.

30
03:12.650 --> 03:15.790
If you're able to guide him around, you'll be set to go.

31
03:15.790 --> 03:18.280
I'm a tough customer to please.

32
03:18.280 --> 03:20.730
I know.

33
03:33.760 --> 03:36.920
- Wow! - Woah!

34
03:48.120 --> 03:54.180
Landscapes, portraits, and then your newest works in the back.

35
03:56.480 --> 03:59.360
[MANDAI x LUN]

36
04:02.240 --> 04:04.300
Who is this?

37
04:04.300 --> 04:06.370
Do you know who she is?

38
04:13.420 --> 04:15.910
That's not an answer.

39
04:15.910 --> 04:17.720
I don't know.

40
04:17.720 --> 04:20.160
I felt a sudden urge to draw this woman yesterday.

41
04:20.160 --> 04:22.140
My pencil wouldn't stop moving.

42
04:22.830 --> 04:24.540
Did you eat?

43
04:25.410 --> 04:27.230
A bit.

44
04:28.600 --> 04:31.640
Should I go get something for you?

45
04:33.400 --> 04:34.830
It's fine.

46
04:36.260 --> 04:39.840
I'm going to take a walk to clear my head.

47
04:50.100 --> 04:52.560
Yum!

48
04:57.110 --> 05:00.460
[Will you marry me?]

49
05:02.500 --> 05:04.580
This is so good.

50
05:10.260 --> 05:11.550
Sakura.

51
05:11.550 --> 05:12.920
Yeah?

52
05:18.780 --> 05:21.060
- Sorry. - It's fine.

53
05:22.860 --> 05:25.490
Natsume, your timing is awful.

54
05:25.490 --> 05:27.360
Sorry to bother on your day off.

55
05:27.360 --> 05:29.590
We're discussing the Katong renovations today.

56
05:29.590 --> 05:31.510
Katong?

57
05:31.510 --> 05:32.920
Does it have to be today?

58
05:32.920 --> 05:35.830
It's the only day we could schedule a meeting.

59
05:35.830 --> 05:37.680
Alright.

60
05:37.680 --> 05:39.420
I'll be right there.

61
05:44.210 --> 05:48.230
Katong... is that the place I asked about this morning?

62
05:48.230 --> 05:49.620
Yeah.

63
05:49.620 --> 05:51.600
I'd like to go there.

64
05:52.200 --> 05:54.680
It seemed like an interesting place.

65
05:55.840 --> 05:57.400
Sure.

66
06:02.120 --> 06:03.960
Stay on the main roads, okay?

67
06:03.960 --> 06:07.690
The back alleys are harder to navigate.

68
06:07.690 --> 06:10.520
When you're done, wait at a cafe. I'll come get you.

69
06:10.520 --> 06:13.280
You don't need to worry, I'll be fine.

70
06:13.280 --> 06:16.830
I know. But I want to, okay?

71
06:17.700 --> 06:19.970
Call or text me if anything crops up.

72
06:19.970 --> 06:22.220
- You too, Eita. - Yeah.

73
06:34.750 --> 06:38.050
[Eita]

74
08:01.410 --> 08:03.430
What just happened?

75
08:07.840 --> 08:11.560
Alright next up, Katong. How's the progress for this one?

76
08:16.100 --> 08:18.860
This neighborhood in particular has a lot of old historic...

77
08:18.860 --> 08:22.560
Ownership of property here gets a bit complicated.

78
08:22.560 --> 08:25.230
Are you listening?

79
08:25.230 --> 08:28.210
Yeah. Sorry.

80
08:28.210 --> 08:32.790
Yeah, that is true. The buildings are certainly colorful on Instagram.

81
08:32.790 --> 08:36.580
It'd be cool if it can kind of go viral.

82
09:22.440 --> 09:25.670
[Eita: It's pouring outside] [Should I come get you now?]

83
09:25.670 --> 09:29.030
Don't worry, it'll let up soon. [Don't worry, it'll let up soon]

84
09:30.350 --> 09:35.180
You can speak Japanese?

85
09:35.180 --> 09:38.380
No. I don't speak Japanese.

86
09:38.380 --> 09:40.160
But you just...

87
09:40.160 --> 09:44.390
Right. I shouldn't know Japanese.

88
09:44.970 --> 09:46.610
I think?

89
09:46.610 --> 09:48.170
You think?

90
09:50.870 --> 09:53.310
That's strange, right?

91
09:57.480 --> 09:59.700
It rains suddenly here.

92
10:01.120 --> 10:02.970
I like that.

93
10:04.180 --> 10:05.820
The squall?

94
10:06.730 --> 10:08.720
No warning.

95
10:10.330 --> 10:12.670
You're a strange one, huh?

96
10:12.670 --> 10:14.440
As are you.

97
10:17.260 --> 10:19.210
Do you draw?

98
10:20.780 --> 10:22.810
Sometimes.

99
10:22.810 --> 10:24.200
Can I see?

100
10:24.200 --> 10:25.980
I used to draw.

101
10:25.980 --> 10:27.620
How about now?

102
10:27.620 --> 10:31.140
I stopped somehow.

103
10:31.140 --> 10:33.490
Somehow.

104
10:33.490 --> 10:35.010
Yes.

105
10:37.090 --> 10:38.540
That's a shame.

106
10:38.540 --> 10:40.840
Would've loved to see your drawings.

107
10:55.960 --> 10:58.430
- I'm sorry! - It's okay.

108
11:05.230 --> 11:09.200
Goodness, your wonderful sketches are ruined.

109
11:11.290 --> 11:13.230
Always the rain, isn't it?

110
11:16.350 --> 11:18.010
Come in.

111
11:18.010 --> 11:19.630
Come in!

112
11:37.830 --> 11:39.720
Please, have a seat wherever.

113
11:39.720 --> 11:41.080
Thank you.

114
11:44.460 --> 11:46.420
I know this place.

115
11:47.910 --> 11:50.020
Have I come here before?

116
12:12.710 --> 12:15.500
I feel like we've met before.

117
12:15.500 --> 12:16.910
Huh?

118
12:16.910 --> 12:18.350
Sorry.

119
12:19.840 --> 12:22.940
I feel like we've met before.

120
12:26.250 --> 12:29.000
Sorry. Nothing.

121
12:42.070 --> 12:43.420
Thank you.

122
12:44.830 --> 12:48.550
Have the two of us dined here before?

123
12:51.600 --> 12:52.870
Who knows?

124
12:52.870 --> 12:57.950
I can't remember every customer who visits. Not at my age.

125
13:11.180 --> 13:14.130
I know this flavor.

126
13:14.130 --> 13:16.010
This tastes nostalgic.

127
13:30.490 --> 13:32.550
- Sakura. - Lun.

128
13:35.540 --> 13:37.940
How do you know my name?

129
13:37.940 --> 13:40.040
How do you know mine?

130
13:46.180 --> 13:49.130
Wei? What brings you here?

131
13:51.830 --> 13:55.200
You're back, Sakura.

132
13:57.670 --> 14:00.080
You know her?

133
14:03.270 --> 14:04.940
What do you want now?

134
14:04.940 --> 14:06.680
Huh?

135
14:06.680 --> 14:10.920
Hold on. She may have something to do with my accident four years ago.

136
14:15.950 --> 14:17.790
We're leaving.

137
14:20.770 --> 14:23.100
You know her, don't you?

138
14:23.100 --> 14:26.200
I don't.

139
14:26.200 --> 14:30.240
- How am I related to her? - Enough!

140
14:30.240 --> 14:32.950
What's all the fuss?

141
14:37.890 --> 14:39.880
Pardon us, ma'am.

142
14:39.880 --> 14:42.400
We'll be out of here in a moment.

143
14:43.000 --> 14:44.510
Let's go.

144
14:55.000 --> 14:56.580
Please.

145
15:10.880 --> 15:12.440
Lun.

146
15:14.910 --> 15:16.640
Lun.

147
15:17.790 --> 15:19.210
We're leaving.

148
15:35.580 --> 15:36.990
Lun...

149
15:41.880 --> 15:43.800
His sketchbook...

150
15:50.310 --> 15:53.000
If it's something important,

151
15:53.000 --> 15:55.040
he'll come back for it, right?

152
15:56.190 --> 16:00.090
May I deliver that to him?

153
16:03.310 --> 16:06.760
May I deliver that sketchbook to him?

154
16:08.100 --> 16:09.850
Why you?

155
16:10.960 --> 16:13.020
I don't know.

156
16:13.020 --> 16:17.040
I just want to.

157
16:33.150 --> 16:39.600
[Rumah Kim Choo]

158
16:41.390 --> 16:43.070
Sakura?

159
16:43.070 --> 16:44.560
Eita.

160
16:44.560 --> 16:46.080
You okay?

161
16:46.800 --> 16:48.180
Yeah.

162
16:50.000 --> 16:51.780
Where'd you get that?

163
16:52.740 --> 16:54.860
A store owner gave it to me.

164
16:54.860 --> 16:58.440
Gave it to you? Why?

165
16:58.440 --> 17:04.820
Eita, have I been to Singapore before?

166
17:05.580 --> 17:07.380
Not as far as I'm aware.

167
17:08.030 --> 17:09.980
Why?

168
17:09.980 --> 17:13.740
Everything just seems so... familiar.

169
17:13.740 --> 17:18.070
You can still feel nostalgic about places you've never been to before.

170
17:18.070 --> 17:19.810
I guess.

171
17:39.450 --> 17:42.260
Wow!

172
17:42.260 --> 17:44.500
The city lights are beautiful!

173
17:44.500 --> 17:45.960
Aren't they?

174
17:54.540 --> 17:57.400
Look, it's glowing up there!

175
17:57.400 --> 17:58.740
You're right.

176
17:58.740 --> 18:00.780
Wow...

177
18:22.150 --> 18:23.920
Sakura.

178
18:23.920 --> 18:25.240
Yeah?

179
18:27.880 --> 18:30.930
- I... - What was that?

180
18:32.930 --> 18:36.410
- I love you! - Stop it, you're embarrassing me!

181
18:40.280 --> 18:43.080
I had planned to ask

182
18:43.080 --> 18:46.020
once we settled in a bit more, but...

183
18:47.250 --> 18:48.730
Yeah?

184
19:00.780 --> 19:02.840
Will you marry me?

185
19:32.370 --> 19:33.570
Sakura?

186
19:33.570 --> 19:35.070
Sakura?

187
19:35.740 --> 19:37.070
Sakura!

188
19:53.760 --> 19:56.860
You're okay. What a relief.

189
19:56.860 --> 19:58.680
I...

190
20:00.420 --> 20:01.810
Here.

191
20:01.810 --> 20:03.860
Thanks.

192
20:03.860 --> 20:08.420
You must have been tired. Rest up for tomorrow.

193
20:08.420 --> 20:10.660
Thanks.

194
20:10.660 --> 20:12.500
I have to call your mother.

195
20:12.500 --> 20:15.800
I promised I'd tell her when you woke up.

196
20:15.800 --> 20:17.670
You contacted her?

197
20:17.670 --> 20:22.310
Of course I did. I whisked away her only daughter to foreign lands.

198
20:22.310 --> 20:24.210
You didn't have to.

199
20:24.210 --> 20:26.440
Don't say that.

200
20:47.650 --> 20:49.320
Sakura.

201
21:22.720 --> 21:24.520
What're you doing?

202
21:26.130 --> 21:29.640
I think I can finally complete my sketch.

203
22:12.060 --> 22:14.010
203...

204
22:26.850 --> 22:28.570
Sakura!
